{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13772","headline":"庐山瀑布歌送李顾 · 顾况","name":"庐山瀑布歌送李顾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘白霓，挂丹梯。\n应从织女机边落，不遣浔阳湖向西。\n火雷劈山珠喷日，五老峰前九江溢。\n九江悠悠万古情，古人行尽今人行。\n老人也欲上山去，上个深山无姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}